WEBVTT

23:00.989 --> 23:03.659
And how's that going,
Commander Mormont?

23:03.784 --> 23:05.285
Slowly.

23:07.663 --> 23:10.832
A raven came... for Ned Stark's son.

23:15.170 --> 23:17.214
Good news or bad?

23:17.339 --> 23:18.924
Both.

23:20.342 --> 23:23.512
MAESTER PYCELLE: Lord Stark.

23:23.637 --> 23:26.431
(WHEEZING) I meant...
to give you this earlier.

23:28.684 --> 23:30.727
So forgetful these days.
